 * isalnum, isdigit, isspace, isnumeric, isdecimal). Operates directly on the
 * character data of NPY_UNICODE / NPY_STRING arrays, avoiding the per-element
 * Python scalar creation and method dispatch overhead of _vec_string_no_args.
